## Performance Optimizations

### Caching
- Market data cached in Redis (if available)
- Filter results cached for 1 minute
- AI analysis results cached for 5 minutes

### Queue Management
- Long operations queued (backtesting, AI analysis)
- High-priority queue for execution
- Low-priority queue for analytics

### Database Optimization
- Indexes on foreign keys and queried columns
- Partitioning for large tables (market_data, execution_logs)
- Regular cleanup of old data

## Security Considerations

### Credential Storage
- Exchange API keys encrypted in database
- Broker credentials encrypted
- AI API keys managed via AI Connection Addon

### Access Control
- Admin-only modules: `global_settings`, `marketplace` (admin side)
- User modules: All modules have user UI
- Permission checks in controllers

### Rate Limiting
- API calls to exchanges rate-limited
- AI API calls rate-limited via AI Connection Addon
- User actions rate-limited (prevent abuse)

